  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "nv_concept",
      "type": "note",
      "text": "**Concept:** Post-Mustafar Darth Vader, Dark Lord of the Sith, Supreme Commander of the Imperial Navy. Cybernetically kept alive inside a pressurized armored suit. Master of Form V (Djem So) lightsaber combat. Uses telekinesis for Force choke, push, and pulling weapons from distance.\n\n**Power level:** 500 pts (super-heroic).\n\n**Signature moves:**\n- Telekinetic Force Choke — Quick Contest of TK ST (25) vs. victim's HT/ST.\n- Force Push — throw objects or people using TK ST 25.\n- Lightsaber throw — Throwing skill at lvl 15, guided home telekinetically.\n- Saber duel — Force Sword 19, parry 13 (+1 from CR, +3 from Weapon Master is via damage bonus, not parry).\n\n**Lightsaber damage:** 8d(5) burn base. With Weapon Master (Force Sword) add +1/die = 8d+8(5) burn. Average ~36 injury after ×1 burn multiplier, shredding any normal DR."
    }
  ],
